#==============================================================================================
#
#   style_sheet_invalidation_2 - CSS::StyleSheetInvalidation II: invalidating the owners of a
#                                style sheet, inserted @keyframes, and how shadow-root sheets
#                                reach the host side
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleSheetInvalidation.cpp (lines 383-641): inserted style rules and
#       @keyframes rules, the trees a shadow-root sheet change affects, the elements whose
#       animation-name references an inserted @keyframes, ShadowRootStylesheetEffects of a
#       sheet or a shadow root, and invalidate_style_for_style_sheet_owners.
